OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK's Richard Tice
OL,4,Aquestioned on Farage, council tax and
OL,5,Amigration on BBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to BBC Hereford & Worcester's
OL,8,FMalcolm Boyden, Tice defended his
OL,9,Fparty's decision to increase council
OL,10,Ftax by 9% while it was in minority
OL,11,Fcontrol of Worcestershire County
OL,12,FCouncil
OL,14,FTice then dodged questions from BBC
OL,15,FRadio Sheffield's Paulette Edwards
OL,16,Fabout Barnsley Council's plans to scale
OL,17,Fback its school uniform voucher scheme
OL,18,F- Reform UK took control of the council
OL,19,Fin May
